lorers alike. Rush through at top speed or ride the rails at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/4801d72672319a5f6041a59b20fca41c.avif?t=1753001605\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.poster.avif?t=1753001605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.webm?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.mp4?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not only about action and jumps, you will face multiple mental challenges and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/f3c1e34bc26a3259bb3058a6fcde852d.avif?t=1753001605\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/52e9d69de84ef769c17368b7cff0c2b0.poster.avif?t=1753001605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/52e9d69de84ef769c17368b7cff0c2b0.webm?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/52e9d69de84ef769c17368b7cff0c2b0.mp4?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Mojito to look like your favorite cat! Use the editor\u2019s full color palette, pattern selection, and wide range of textures to make it truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/b06c9db9f9064666c407557969c86dd5.avif?t=1753001605\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/fc177f5656e94d9e2b0a7dce650fd0b8.poster.avif?t=1753001605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/fc177f5656e94d9e2b0a7dce650fd0b8.webm?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/fc177f5656e94d9e2b0a7dce650fd0b8.mp4?t=1753001605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mojito needs your help! If you like this project, please consider supporting it on kickstarter and Wishlisting on Steam!</p>",
